# Facts about Seraphine Hale.

@fact seraphine.seer
tier: surface
text: A seer who speaks in half-sentences and is unsettlingly often right.

@fact seraphine.slips
tier: personal
unlock: seen(seraphine_lost_day) > 0
text: Sometimes she slips a day ahead and needs someone to tell her what today is.

@fact seraphine.oracle
tier: personal
unlock: rel(seraphine) >= 15
text: Her mother is the Oracle of Vell, who wants her home to tell kings what they want to hear.

@fact seraphine.self
tier: personal
unlock: seen(seraphine_painting) > 0
text: Seers can't see themselves, unless someone is standing next to them.

@fact seraphine.lake
tier: secret
unlock: flag(seraphine_lake_told)
text: The lake calls to her at night. She says it calls to you too.

@fact seraphine.too_loud
tier: secret
unlock: seen(seraphine_overwhelmed) > 0
text: When everyone's futures get too loud she hides in the dark. Yours, she says, is quiet.
